        "collapsible_row_custom_aagMJW": {
          "type": "collapsible_row_custom",
          "settings": {
            "icon_1": "shopify://shop_images/ant-design_product-filled.svg",
            "q_1": "Natural Astaxanthin 12mg",
            "a_1": "<p><strong>Natural Astaxanthin 12mg</strong> from Haematococcus pluvialis microalgae. Sunflower oil for absorption. Softgel capsule (gelatin, purified water). That's it.</p><p>No fillers. No synthetic astaxanthin. No artificial anything. 30 softgels per bag, full 1-month supply. Non-GMO, gluten-free, soy-free.</p>",
            "icon_2": "shopify://shop_images/mingcute_question-fill.svg",
            "q_2": "Clean & Trusted",
            "a_2": "<p>cGMP certified, FDA-registered facility. 3rd party lab tested every batch. Oil-based softgel for real absorption, not powder capsules that pass right through you. We sell direct only. No Amazon, no middlemen.</p>",
            "icon_3": "shopify://shop_images/mingcute_bug-fill.svg",
            "q_3": "How Does It Work for Fertility?",
            "a_3": "<p>Declining sperm health isn't just a numbers problem. The real damage happens inside the cell membrane, where oxidative stress silently breaks down developing sperm before they ever make it onto a lab report. That's why a normal-looking lifestyle doesn't always mean normal numbers.</p><p>Most things marketed for fertility float in your bloodstream. They never actually get inside the cell where the damage is happening.</p><p>Astaxanthin is one of the only compounds on earth that's both fat-soluble and water-soluble at the same time. That's what lets it physically cross into the cell membrane where developing sperm are made and protect them while they mature. Once inside, it neutralizes the free radicals driving the breakdown and shields the cell from further oxidative damage.</p><p>It doesn't force a number up overnight. It protects the next generation of sperm your body is already making, every single day.</p>",
            "icon_4": "shopify://shop_images/mdi_thunder-circle.svg",
            "q_4": "How Long Before I See Results?",
            "a_4": "<p>Most people notice a shift in how they feel well before any lab number moves, because sperm takes time to mature — that part isn’t optional, it’s biology.</p><p><strong>First few days:</strong> Energy and drive start to shift. A lot of guys say this is the first time in a while they’ve felt like they’re actually doing something about it.</p><p><strong>Week 2–4:</strong> Astaxanthin is building up in your tissue. It doesn’t flush out like other supplements. Your body is protecting the sperm currently developing right now.</p><p><strong>Week 6–8:</strong> The sperm that were forming when you started are now maturing inside a protected environment. This is the generation that shows up on your next test.</p><p><strong>Day 90:</strong> A full sperm production cycle has completed. This is when a semen analysis actually reflects the difference — not before, because sperm made yesterday isn’t what gets tested today.</p><p>Cellular protection compounds. Don’t quit early. You’re protected by a 60-day guarantee either way.</p>",
            "icon_5": "shopify://shop_images/Group.svg",
            "q_5": "Recommended Use",
            "a_5": "<p>One softgel a day. Take it with a meal that has fat (eggs, avocado, salmon, olive oil, peanut butter). Astaxanthin is fat-soluble, so it absorbs 3-4x better with food fats. Morning or night, doesn't matter. Pick a time you'll remember.</p><p>That's it. No stack. No timing tricks. One pill, one meal, every day.</p>",
            "icon_6": "shopify://shop_images/Vector.svg",
            "q_6": "Do You Offer a Guarantee?",
            "a_6": "<p>30 days. Full refund. No questions. If you don't feel a difference, we refund every penny. Even if the bag is empty.<br/><br/></p>",
            "q_7": "",
            "a_7": "",
            "q_8": "",
            "a_8": "",
            "q_9": "",
            "a_9": "",
            "q_10": "",
            "a_10": "",
