            "star_color_filled": "#e8a020",
            "star_color_empty": "#dddddd",
            "heading": "we were trying for almost two years before i even got tested.",
            "body": "I kept assuming it was just a matter of time. My wife finally convinced me to get a semen analysis and the number wasn't what I expected. Started taking this the same week. Three months later, my retest came back noticeably better. I wish I hadn't waited two years to find out it might have been me.",
            "avatar": "shopify://shop_images/ia_100000036.png",
            "name": "David L."
          }
        },
        "card_pdp_02": {
          "type": "card",
          "settings": {
            "rating": 5,
            "star_color_filled": "#e8a020",
            "star_color_empty": "#dddddd",
            "heading": "got the call we'd been waiting 14 months for.",
