            "heading": "the diagnosis took my confidence. this helped me get it back.",
            "body": "Urologist said my count was low and couldn't tell me why. \"Idiopathic\" is the word he used, which is doctor for \"we don't know.\" That was a hard appointment to sit through. Started taking this and by week 6 I at least felt like I was doing something proactive instead of just waiting around for the next test. On my third bag now.",
