    "nvgd_review_grid_VfVdcT": {
      "type": "nvgd-review-grid",
      "blocks": {
        "review_group_UPBFta": {
          "type": "review_group",
          "settings": {
            "name_1": "Lorraine W.",
            "rating_1": 5,
            "text_1": "started this after our urologist said my husband's motility was low. we'd tried zinc and folic acid for 8 months with basically no change on his retests. switched to this alongside it and his 90-day semen analysis showed real improvement. nobody told us motility could actually change this much. this supplement told us.",
            "image_url_1": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w11_7056f3bb-dc97-4fa9-8f2a-9467dde3d22f.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_2": "Tammy R.",
            "rating_2": 5,
            "text_2": "my husband's count came back at 8 million after we'd been trying for over a year. i read about oxidative stress and sperm dna fragmentation and asked him to try this. about 3 months in his retest came back at 22 million. i cried in the car after the appointment because i forgot what hope felt like.",
            "image_url_2": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w15.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_3": "Earl R.",
            "rating_3": 5,
            "text_3": "retired at 60, been trying to have a second kid with my younger wife for 2 years. doctor said age plays a role but so does everything else. 3 months in and my retest numbers moved more than the doctor expected. first good news we've had in a while.",
            "image_url_3": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m9_087d5b1c-48d6-4842-b8c2-f1d92a1ddeb6.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_4": "Colleen M.",
            "rating_4": 5,
            "text_4": "my husband's varicocele surgery didn't fix the numbers like we hoped. his urologist recommended this alongside recovery. 90 days in and his retest showed real improvement. my husband said watching those follow-up appointments used to make him nervous. not anymore.",
            "image_url_4": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w7_b42d7f54-6003-4189-a0f9-fd34e4427f02.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_5": "Marlene H.",
            "rating_5": 5,
            "text_5": "the worst part of this whole process wasn't the tests. it was every negative pregnancy test after. we tried zinc for months. folic acid for a year. nothing moved the needle. this was different. by month 3 his numbers had actually changed.",
            "image_url_5": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w8_0fa9eeb2-e605-4cdc-9aa4-a569f2aed024.png?v=1776370451"
          }
        },
        "review_group_aepe6i": {
          "type": "review_group",
          "settings": {
            "name_1": "Steve K.",
            "rating_1": 5,
            "text_1": "my count came back low about 4 months ago. added this and by week 6 my energy was noticeably up. by month 3 my retest showed real movement. my urologist asked what changed because the jump was bigger than expected.",
            "image_url_1": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m10_804de057-76fa-4ad9-b698-e5e40ed2a3e5.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_2": "Irene P.",
            "rating_2": 5,
            "text_2": "my husband's motility numbers were so low the doctor mentioned iui as our likely next step. started this and the numbers on his 90-day retest went up enough that we're trying naturally a bit longer first. the little wins hit different when you've lost hope.",
            "image_url_2": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w17.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_3": "Annette M.",
            "rating_3": 5,
            "text_3": "every appointment for a year felt like bad news. tried zinc for a year. folic acid for 6 months. nothing. started this and by month 3 the retest numbers were meaningfully better. my husband noticed the shift before i did.",
            "image_url_3": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w16.png?v=1776370451",
            "name_4": "Ray D.",
            "rating_4": 5,
            "text_4": "both my count and motility were flagged low at our first workup. getting through each appointment took a toll. around week 8 i had more energy day to day. by the 90-day retest, both numbers had moved in the right direction.",
            "image_url_4": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m14.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_5": "Susan T.",
            "rating_5": 5,
            "text_5": "my husband's count dropped out of nowhere after years of normal results. doctor said it happens, gave us general lifestyle advice. that advice didn't move anything for two cycles. started this and by month 3 the numbers started climbing. i actually laughed with relief.",
            "image_url_5": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w13.png?v=1776370450"
          }
        },
        "review_group_YDE7Jn": {
          "type": "review_group",
          "settings": {
            "name_1": "Loretta A.",
            "rating_1": 5,
            "text_1": "his sperm dna fragmentation came back high some mornings we just sat in silence after appointments. by week 6 his energy was up. by the 90-day retest the fragmentation numbers had improved. his urologist asked what changed.",
            "image_url_1": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w9_b40890a1-698d-4e7d-9880-f75b3020ea78.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_2": "Wayne L.",
            "rating_2": 5,
            "text_2": "we'd been trying for over a year and a half. started this and nothing felt different for weeks. by month 3 his retest numbers had moved more than either of us expected. you don't realize what you'd given up hoping for until you get some of it back.",
            "image_url_2": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m11.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_3": "Faye J.",
            "rating_3": 5,
            "text_3": "52 and trying for our first with a younger partner. my doctor kept saying age matters but so does everything else. started this and 90 days in my numbers had actually improved. 10 weeks after that we got the call we'd been hoping for.",
            "image_url_3": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w5_022bb544-74b1-46ae-919f-fd9889915afb.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_4": "Craig T.",
            "rating_4": 5,
            "text_4": "had a vasectomy reversal years ago and it never fully worked like we hoped. constant low numbers, limited options. this is the first thing where i actually saw a difference. around week 8 my energy picked up. by the 90-day retest my count had moved.",
            "image_url_4": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m3_a8e72f00-65d5-4550-bf4c-294e6bd8da01.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_5": "Gail W.",
            "rating_5": 5,
            "text_5": "my husband's numbers from the fertility clinic were so bad we were bracing for ivf. i have never written a review in my life but this one i had to. 90 days later his retest was dramatically better. not perfect but manageable, and that was all we needed.",
            "image_url_5": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w4_c6edae75-76c5-4a17-84bc-add1e9c5876f.png?v=1776370450"
          }
        },
        "review_group_T8RAiD": {
          "type": "review_group",
          "settings": {
            "name_1": "Wanda K.",
            "rating_1": 5,
            "text_1": "my husband's motility was so low the doctor mentioned donor sperm as an option. by week 5 his energy was noticeably up. by the 90-day retest his motility had improved enough that we're not having that conversation anymore, at least for now.",
            "image_url_1": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w3_c2ba75e1-c21c-4992-abab-07a64d3ddec2.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_2": "Dale H.",
            "rating_2": 5,
            "text_2": "both of us were so anxious about every appointment we could barely talk about it. my husband's urologist actually suggested astaxanthin for the oxidative stress angle. 90 days in and his retest numbers improved noticeably. talking about appointments doesn't make me flinch anymore.",
            "image_url_2": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m6_ae62afa2-4061-4673-a24d-0a560be7b1ad.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_3": "Donna M.",
            "rating_3": 5,
            "text_3": "retired 2 years ago and figured our fertility struggles were just part of getting older. both of us just accepted it. my daughter kept sending me links and i kept ignoring her. finally tried it for my husband. 90 days in and his numbers that i'd braced myself to accept just started improving. wish we hadn't waited so long.",
            "image_url_3": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w12.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_4": "Hal P.",
            "rating_4": 5,
            "text_4": "48 years old. my numbers are nowhere near what they were in my 20s. this stuff doesn't reverse age obviously but the retest numbers moved by week 8. i went from dreading appointments to actually looking forward to the next one. that's a win at my age.",
            "image_url_4": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m15.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_5": "Margaret L.",
            "rating_5": 5,
            "text_5": "my husband's numbers had been stuck low for 5 months. his doctor said it could take a year or more to improve on its own. started this and the improvement happened faster than anyone expected. week 4 his energy started picking up. week 8 his retest showed real movement. his urologist was genuinely surprised at the timeline.",
            "image_url_5": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w18.png?v=1776370450"
          }
        },
        "review_group_QHcHcT": {
          "type": "review_group",
          "settings": {
            "name_1": "Dennis J.",
            "rating_1": 5,
            "text_1": "my doctor put me on a blood pressure medication that's known to affect fertility. tried a generic multivitamin for 4 months. nothing. started this and by week 5 my energy started lifting. by the 90-day retest my numbers had actually moved.",
            "image_url_1": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m2_2556b9bb-26bf-4190-b10e-3b564db33c58.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_2": "Arlene D.",
            "rating_2": 5,
            "text_2": "my husband's count was so low he stopped wanting to talk about it — his hobby of even discussing kids for 30 years shut down completely. by 90 days his retest numbers went up enough that we're talking about trying again. im hopeful for the first time in a while.",
            "image_url_2": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w2_cef21a0f-60dc-4493-a4a5-5305548c27e5.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_3": "Pamela C.",
            "rating_3": 5,
            "text_3": "fertility struggles are real and i am tired of doctors acting like there's nothing to be done. my husband's numbers, our timeline, our stress — none of them said anything helpful beyond 'keep trying.' this supplement does what our doctor couldn't. 90 days in and the difference is undeniable.",
            "image_url_3": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w1_6793d2d5-118e-4cbb-98cf-c627587795cb.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_4": "Keith T.",
            "rating_4": 5,
            "text_4": "low motility for over a year. couldn't get a straight answer on next steps. week 4 my energy started picking up. by the 90-day retest i was seeing real movement. slow comeback but its a comeback.",
            "image_url_4": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m1_ef2b7eef-fcf2-4962-9baa-8b8203d7d541.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_5": "Cynthia R.",
            "rating_5": 5,
            "text_5": "we were popping ovulation tests and stressing every single cycle. my stomach was a mess from the anxiety. by week 6 my husband's energy was up. by week 10 his retest numbers were genuinely better. this replaced a cycle of dread that was destroying us.",
            "image_url_5": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w10_3414631a-45e3-47f2-9d43-46a2a4e928ec.png?v=1776370450"
          }
        },
        "review_group_tdz3wF": {
          "type": "review_group",
          "settings": {
            "name_1": "Brenda S.",
            "rating_1": 5,
            "text_1": "bought this for my husband because he was waking up at 3am every night stressing about our numbers. 4 weeks in his energy leveled out and he slept through the night. i know because i did too. best purchase ive made in years.",
            "image_url_1": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w6_06e96ecb-72db-46f5-a723-15210b30ede2.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_2": "Trevor S.",
            "rating_2": 5,
            "text_2": "gym guy. 44 years old. started getting flagged low on semen analysis out of nowhere. week 3 my energy was noticeably up. by week 6 the anxiety around appointments was mostly gone. easiest addition to my stack.",
            "image_url_2": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m13.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_3": "Debra K.",
            "rating_3": 5,
            "text_3": "my husband's numbers were unbearable to talk about. couldnt bring it up without one of us getting upset. 6 weeks in and we can talk about it without wanting to cry. not perfectly comfortable but progress i didnt think was possible.",
            "image_url_3": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/w14.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_4": "Renee R.",
            "rating_4": 5,
            "text_4": "57, trying for a second with my younger husband, his numbers were so low every appointment felt like a countdown. tried everything. thousands of dollars. this is the only thing that actually moved his retest. by month 2 we were just moving forward. no bracing. just moving forward.",
            "image_url_4": "",
            "name_5": "Curt A.",
            "rating_5": 5,
            "text_5": "i dont write reviews. ever. but this one earned it. low count for 6 months. couldnt get a straight answer from anyone. added this and the progress accelerated noticeably starting week 4. by week 10 my retest showed real movement. thats all i have to say.",
            "image_url_5": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m7_ea7157a1-f119-48de-8841-7a304877cee5.png?v=1776370450"
          }
        },
        "review_group_V8gcJa": {
          "type": "review_group",
          "settings": {
            "name_1": "Marie B.",
            "rating_1": 5,
            "text_1": "58 years old and my husband's fertility appointments woke us both up with dread every time one was scheduled. took about 5 weeks but his energy picked up dramatically. i actually feel hopeful now.",
            "image_url_1": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/b2.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_2": "Penny B.",
            "rating_2": 5,
            "text_2": "my husband's numbers were frozen solid, no movement for 8 months. getting through appointments was a nightmare, i had to hold his hand through every one. within a month things started shifting. his urologist kept saying she was surprised how fast the numbers were moving. by month 3 his retest was the best it had been in years. i get emotional thinking about it because i really thought we'd lost that window.",
            "image_url_2": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/b3.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_3": "Hank D.",
            "rating_3": 5,
            "text_3": "55 years old. low numbers from decades of stress and bad habits. by week 5 my energy was up. by week 8 my retest showed the first real movement in years. something changed and i can feel it.",
            "image_url_3": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m8_9f4b979e-9667-4ea5-8847-193a0e2f1f72.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_4": "Martha T.",
            "rating_4": 5,
            "text_4": "everything about our fertility journey hurt. every appointment, every test, every negative result. my gp said its normal at our age. im 51. thats not that old. 7 weeks in and the anxiety is probably 60% reduced. not gone but i feel human again.",
            "image_url_4": "",
            "name_5": "Vince B.",
            "rating_5": 5,
            "text_5": "had a failed ivf cycle 10 years ago and gave up trying. this is the first supplement that actually kept the retests from disappointing us. 3 months in and ive had zero bad appointments. not fewer. zero. thats never happened.",
            "image_url_5": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m4_9d88d246-bcac-42bf-958d-e2c28e37d327.png?v=1776370450"
          }
        },
        "review_group_Ab4xEx": {
          "type": "review_group",
          "settings": {
            "name_1": "Bonnie W.",
            "rating_1": 5,
            "text_1": "ignored my daughter's link three times for my husband. finally ordered because she wouldnt stop. 6 weeks later i called her and said you were right. his retest numbers are genuinely better. kids should push their parents more.",
            "image_url_1": "",
            "name_2": "Joyce P.",
            "rating_2": 5,
            "text_2": "my husband's count dropped 8 months ago. then his motility started dropping too. the count started improving faster than expected and the motility never fully cratered. i genuinely believe this prevented the second problem from getting as bad.",
            "image_url_2": "",
            "name_3": "Glen F.",
            "rating_3": 5,
            "text_3": "61. both count and motility low. my doctor wanted to move straight to ivf. i wanted to try something else first. 8 weeks in my numbers improved enough that my doctor agreed to hold off. still improving at week 12.",
            "image_url_3": "https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0732/4329/5930/files/m5_28e1614e-c265-42d9-b9bf-33fd207ebc80.png?v=1776370450",
            "name_4": "Elaine D.",
            "rating_4": 5,
            "text_4": "our fertility struggles gave me anxiety i didnt even know was possible. tried turmeric. cold showers. cutting sugar. nothing helped enough. this is the first thing that actually moved my husband's retest numbers enough that we could function normally. week 6 was when we felt the shift.",
